T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Pellizari, a Brazilian pioneer in studies of microorganisms that live under extreme) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(conditions. Years later, the sequenced genetic material was analyzed again, identifying a) Tj
T*
